WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.350
Friendship doesn't exist!

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:45.000
The End of Gobi

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.870
It's back to normal!

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.090
It's completely back, capisce!

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:40.610
Ah, I've gotta find Mirei and the gang.

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:42.050
I'm sure they were safe.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.480
I'm worried about Hibiki-san too.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.020
I feel like I'm forgetting something.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:53.380
I wonder what it is...

00:02:58.340 --> 00:02:59.360
What could it be?

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.980
On second thought, I'm not forgetting anything.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:04.940
This is good.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:18.920
Eiko-chan!

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:21.510
Hello.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.400
Eiko, I'm so happy to see you, capisce!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.200
Do I know you?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.870
You... are Eiko-chan, right?

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.760
You said you were my number one fan.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.660
Weirdo.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.360
Wait, Eiko-chan!

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.380
What...?

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.290
What's going on?

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.530
Chanko-san, Sadako-san!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.480
Walking past each other as if they were total strangers.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.480
Love-chan, Nodoka-chan, Nagisa-chan!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.330
Teiko-san, New & Mew-san!

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:55.290
The Headmistress and Rina-chan too?

00:03:58.510 --> 00:03:59.480
Sorry.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.180
Hanana-chan!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.760
Even Hanana-chan...

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.100
Kuma-san, Usagi-san are you here?

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.810
Their stuffing is gone!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:21.400
The system has started self-destructing!

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.800
The system's broke...

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.380
I don't know why

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.580
but something vital has broken!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.590
Soda is delicious, tension max!

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.340
It's so sweet and melts in your mouth!

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.900
Dorothy, Leona!

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.340
Leona! Dorothy just said tension max!

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.350
Why didn't you say relax!?

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.520
What are you talking about?

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.920
Leona, you've forgotten about Dorothy?

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.650
What about me? Aren't we friends?

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.570
Friends? What are they?

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.360
Friends are friends!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.530
Laughing together, crying together,

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.740
singing together, dancing together.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.410
Fighting, making up, snapping tickets.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.440
Look, all our snapped friend tickets.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.000
If we snap tickets, we'll be friends, we're all friends!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.390
Huh? They're not here...

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.260
What on earth...

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:25.320
If you're not going to praise me, then I'm leaving.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.750
Cya later.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.470
Wait, Dorothy!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.850
What is she on about?

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:35.760
Dorothy!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.650
Dero dero dero saimu!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.680
Nikuman are delicious-nano!

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.570
Bless me with the strongest cursed power-devi!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:46.990
Devi!

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.910
Even Aroma and Mikan...

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:54.410
Does friendship not exist in this PriPara?

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.180
Everyone has forgotten their friends.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.800
Ouch capisce!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.900
It's not a dream.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.780
This world where friendship exists is gone

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.920
along with my friends...

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:14.500
It's so dry, cold and lonely.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:19.230
It's like Hibiki-san's heart, after all she said she "doesn't need friends".

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.670
I love this world!

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:26.790
It's so quiet, no rambunctiousness.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:32.320
But, I'm sure I'm forgetting something...

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:36.280
Fu...

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:37.970
Fu...

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:39.930
Fuwa...

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.200
No, Fa...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.040
Ah whatever.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.730
Mirei!

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:05.680
Mirei.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.130
Mirei will remember me, right?

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:11.370
Mire...

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.440
Wait!

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:21.000
Coming within a one metre radius of me without permission is a violation of the idol rules!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.450
She has no sentence ender...

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.250
Mirei, it's me Lala!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.100
Lala! Lala!

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.070
Lala?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.830
Even you've forgotten!?

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.470
No, please no!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:33.180
W-wait!
No, please no!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:33.840
W-wait!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.770
Mirei! It's me Lala!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.120
It's not possible for you to forget me!

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.960
Mirei you idiot, you're horrible!

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.520
Please remember, Mirei!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.400
Scary...

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.720
Even Mirei...

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.830
What should I do?

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:04.160
I applied for a two person concert,
and I cant do it alone-pri!

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.200
Please, give me some kindness.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.140
Form a group with me and let's perform-pri!

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.300
What was up with her?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.600
Hey!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:29.490
I applied for a two person concert,
and I cant do it alone!

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.280
Please form a pair with me and perform!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.520
A two person concert? Do those exist?

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.700
Concerts are something you do alone.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.660
Do you like PriPara?

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:42.760
I guess so.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.530
Do I like PriPara?

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.250
Let me go.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.370
I won't until you remember me!

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.950
I won't until you say we're friends!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:03.440
Friends? What are those?

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.360
Friends are friends!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.470
Calculate it! You're good at that!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:09.350
How do you...

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.490
Calculate it!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:17.240
Hmm that's strange, I can't find an answer.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.830
The fact that you can't find an answer makes this a strange world!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.750
It's not the real PriPara!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.710
You don't even have your sentence ender!

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:25.820
Pri?

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.880
Pri! Remember it!

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.200
Not the real PriPara?

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.220
Psshuuuuu.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.320
Sophie!

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:42.220
Sophie?

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.450
Oh no!

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.810
Do you know her?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.990
It's Sophie, she's our friend!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.350
Sophie? Friend?

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.420
Sophie, stay with us!

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.400
I don't know who you are, but get it together!

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.900
Psshuuu

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.020
Pshuu?

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:09.860
We're all over the show!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.500
C-capisce!

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:12.440
Capisce?

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.810
Sophie, I'm sorry, are you okay?

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.080
Pshuuu.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.760
Capisce!

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:20.850
Pshuu.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:21.680
Capisce!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:25.140
Pri Pri! Capisce! Pshuuuu.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.120
Capisce.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.170
Capisce!

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.910
Pri Pri! Capisce! Pri Pri! Capisce!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:34.520
We're in sync!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.690
Pri Pri! Capisce!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:42.530
Capisce!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.670
Pri Pri.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.720
Capisce!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:45.660
Pri Pri!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.650
Capisce!

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:47.640
Pri Pri!

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:48.500
Capisce!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.920
Pri Pri!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.670
Mirei, have you remembered?

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.320
Lala!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.060
Mirei, welcome back!

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:57.880
Mirei, Mirei, Mirei, Mirei!

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.020
Lala, Lala, Lala, Lala!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.720
I'm back Lala, you really gave it your all!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.240
Prii! Pri Pri Pri!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.230
Pop step get you-pri!

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.640
Mirei, Mirei, Mirei, Mirei, Mirei!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.890
Okay, let's get it done-pri!

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:16.280
Let's sing and make everyone remember-pri!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.780
Our friends, our pals, let's make them all remember!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.110
Do you like PriPara-pri?

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.370
Yeah!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.040
Then it's no problem, you can do it-pri!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.670
Everyone's waiting for us idols to sing-pri!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.880
Let's sing to the world with all our hearts-pri!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.120
All girls are accepted here-pri!

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.970
Accepted with all our hearts.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:43.390
Capisce!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.770
Sophie, listen to this and remember!

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.540
Everyone, listen!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.500
Remember, the real PriPara!

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.960
We'll bring back the old PriPara!

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.670
We'll bring it back!

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:22.340
Le...

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.210
Here we go!

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.110
Sophie!

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.600
You remembered!

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:19.690
I'm back!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.880
Welcome back!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.510
Here we go!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:55.780
Leona!

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:56.940
Dorothy!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.850
Shion!

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.750
Dorothy, Leona!

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.490
Here we go!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.580
Here we go!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.060
Aroma!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:05.000
Paw!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.160
I love you Aroma-nano!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:15.070
What are you guys doing-kuma?

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:15.760
Tori?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.330
I feel like I've hibernated, I'm full of vim now-usa!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.600
Nekon!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.700
Rina-chan!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.710
Hibiki-san, where are you?

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:39.410
Making Drama, switch on!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.680
Let's play together! PriPara Hills!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:00.370
Cyalume Change!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:01.990
Parajuku Operating System now rebooting.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.960
My glasses are now back!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.060
Mine too!

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:29.020
The system has been reset.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:31.930
Maho-chan.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:46.660
Fuwari.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.210
Hibiki-san!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.130
Fuwari!

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:07.550
Fuwari... why?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.960
I won't let you be alone anymore!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.940
Fuwari, I'm so sorry for all of this!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.420
I understand the meaning of "Immortal Friend Ticket" now.

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:20.670
Hibiki-san.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.620
Curly-chan!

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.150
Let's be friends!

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:28.580
Käthe Kollwitz-daVinci!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.550
Hibiki-san!

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:30.730
Käthe Kollwitz-daVinci!

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:33.380
Oh no!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.620
Fuwari!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:37.610
Toriko-san!

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:42.140
Toriko is the bird of power!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:45.980
Kiki Ajimi...

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.050
Why do you follow me so...

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:49.940
Huh?

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.370
Because I want to be your friend!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:56.350
Huh? F-Friend?

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:57.860
Yes.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.790
You've followed me all this time to be friends?

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:02.910
Yes!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.280
I-I see...

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.750
That's great!

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.230
Will you be my friend?

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:12.710
I-I guess...

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.470
Let's start from "complete strangers".

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.400
The hole is so small.

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:27.180
Maho-chan!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.460
The light!

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.770
Everyone can make it-tori!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.400
Maho-chan...

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.320
It's become a mussel worm.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.390
What's happening Meganii-pri?

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.670
PriPara was restarted,

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.810
and all elements of CelePara were eliminated.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.530
When we restarted the system from zero and so,

00:19:55.530 --> 00:20:00.750
the anomaly, aka Hibiki-san belonging to CelePara is being eliminated.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:02.010
That can't be...

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:07.080
At this rate they'll be eliminated along with CelePara's data.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.550
It's the system.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.460
Does that mean her ribution has come?

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:12.380
Dorothy!

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.230
It'll be fine!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.630
Nobody will get hurt in my beloved PriPara!

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.650
Not Fuwari or Ajimi-sensei!

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:21.640
Nor Hibiki-san!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.320
PriPara is a place that makes everyone happy!

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.360
Well said Lala!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.210
We can perform miracles if we combine our strength!

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.970
Thanks Sophie, Mirei!

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:38.930
Hibiki-san, Fuwari and Ajimi-sensei.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:43.460
We'll find a way to save you all, capisce!
